WCD9320 parent interrupt line, first hardware pass -- Nokia Lumia 1520 (RM-940)
==============================================================================
2026-08-01. Kernel 6.16.12 r125, module wcd9320 irq-observe-rc1.

TLMM 72 requested with the trigger type measured from the Lumia's own DSDT
(rising edge). All usable codec sources explicitly masked. No CDC-core write,
no MCLK write, no analog path touched. The only registers written anywhere
were INTR_MASK0-3.

Analysis: docs/audio/wcd9320-irq-topology.md


